{"bg_img":"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/uploadfile\/image\/20240110\/20240110144516_66910.jpg","category_id":"6a157626b0cd2e35d86fcf74","column_id":"6a154fc77093015d5705df9a","create_time":"2024-01-10 14:40:43","details":"<p style=\"text-indent:2em;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-family:思源黑体;\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/uploadfile\/image\/20240110\/20240110144210_39366.jpg\" alt=\"\" \/><br \/>\r\n<\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"text-indent:2em;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-family:思源黑体;\"><br \/>\r\n<\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"text-indent:2em;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-family:思源黑体;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">随着2018年全球首款siRNA药物获批上市, 2020年底首款mRNA疫苗获批上市, 截至目前，已有18款小核酸药物以及10款mRNA疫苗获批上市。<\/span><\/span>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"text-indent:2em;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-family:思源黑体;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><br \/>\r\n<\/span><\/span>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"text-indent:2em;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-family:思源黑体;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">全球mRNA药物进入临床管线的已有132个，研发主要集中在疫苗领域。据PubMed预测, mRNA市场总规模将在2035年达到230亿美元。<\/span><\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"text-indent:2em;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-family:思源黑体;font-size:14px;\">有鉴于此，xRNA核酸药物开发与创新论坛2024 将邀请并汇聚国内外核酸疫苗与药物研发, 研究机构的专家与科学家，旨在加强交流与合作，聚焦于新一代 mRNA\/circRNA疫苗与药物、寡核苷酸药物开发、临床前与临床研究、递送技术与工艺开发，加速产业化与市场化进程。<\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, MacSystemFont, \" font-size:16px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\"><br \/>\r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family:思源黑体;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#125AAB;font-size:14px;\">会议名称：<\/span><\/strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">xRNA核酸药物开发与创新论坛2024<\/span><\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family:思源黑体;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#125AAB;font-size:14px;\">会议时间：<\/span><\/strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">2024年1月16-17日<\/span><\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family:思源黑体;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#125AAB;font-size:14px;\">会议地点：<\/span><\/strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">苏州阳光城希尔顿酒店<\/span><\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, MacSystemFont, \" font-size:16px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\"><br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:思源黑体;font-size:14px;\">赛诺邦格展位号：C12<\/span>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-family:思源黑体;\"><img src=\"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/uploadfile\/image\/20240110\/20240110144342_30746.png\" alt=\"\" \/><br \/>\r\n<\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-family:思源黑体;\"><br \/>\r\n<\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-family:思源黑体;font-size:14px;\">会议主要专题<\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, MacSystemFont, \" font-size:16px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\"><br \/>\r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family:思源黑体;\"><span style=\"color:#125AAB;font-size:14px;\"><strong>专题一：<\/strong><\/span><span style=\"color:#5C5C5C;font-size:14px;\">mRNA 与环状RNA疫苗\/药物研发<\/span><\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family:思源黑体;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#125AAB;font-size:14px;\">专题二：<\/span><\/strong><span style=\"color:#5C5C5C;font-size:14px;\">mRNA 核酸疫苗\/药物工艺开发与生产；分析与质量控制<\/span><\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family:思源黑体;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#125AAB;font-size:14px;\">专题三：<\/span><\/strong><span style=\"color:#5C5C5C;font-size:14px;\">mRNA 肿瘤疫苗开发<\/span><\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family:思源黑体;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#125AAB;font-size:14px;\">专题四：<\/span><\/strong><span style=\"color:#5C5C5C;font-size:14px;\">mRNA 创新应用 (蛋白替代疗法, 细胞治疗, 基因编辑与再生医学等)<\/span><\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family:思源黑体;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#125AAB;font-size:14px;\">专题五：<\/span><\/strong><span style=\"color:#5C5C5C;font-size:14px;\">寡核苷酸药物研发 (siRNA, ASO 等)<\/span><\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family:思源黑体;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#125AAB;font-size:14px;\">专题六：<\/span><\/strong><span style=\"color:#5C5C5C;font-size:14px;\">寡核苷酸药物工艺开发与生产；分析与质量控制<\/span><\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family:思源黑体;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#125AAB;font-size:14px;\">专题七：<\/span><\/strong><span style=\"color:#5C5C5C;font-size:14px;\">核酸递送策略与技术<\/span><\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<br \/>\r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family:思源黑体;font-size:14px;color:#E53333;\">赛诺邦格将准时参展<\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-family:思源黑体;font-size:14px;color:#E53333;\">欢迎各位新老朋友莅临展位C12<\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, MacSystemFont, \" font-size:16px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\"><br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, MacSystemFont, \" font-size:16px;text-align:justify;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><b><i>展会预告<\/i><\/b><\/span> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t<img src=\"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/uploadfile\/image\/20240110\/20240110144449_44136.jpg\" alt=\"\" \/> \r\n\t<\/p>\r\n<br \/>","intro":"随着2018年全球首款siRNA药物获批上市, 2020年底首款mRNA疫苗获批上市, 截至目前，已有18款小核酸药物以及10款mRNA疫苗获批上市。 全球mRNA药物进入临床管线的已有132个，研发主要集中在疫苗领域。据PubMed预测, mRNA市场总规模将在2035年达到230亿美元。 有鉴于此，xRNA核酸药物","label_id":[],"recommend":false,"readnum":0,"sort":144,"status":1,"title":"赛诺邦格邀请函 | xRNA核酸药物开发与创新论坛2024","type":"content","webDesc":"随着2018年全球首款siRNA药物获批上市, 2020年底首款mRNA疫苗获批上市, 截至目前，已有18款小核酸药物以及10款mRNA疫苗获批上市。 全球mRNA药物进入临床管线的已有132个，研发主要集中在疫苗领域。据PubMed预测, mRNA市场总规模将在2035年达到230亿美元。 有鉴于此，xRNA核酸药物","webKey":"赛诺邦格邀请函 | xRNA核酸药物开发与创新论坛2024","webTitle":"赛诺邦格邀请函 | xRNA核酸药物开发与创新论坛2024","site_id":"6a1530e4fd909f645a4db75e","is_top":0,"update_time":"2026-05-28 17:4